  "pageshortdescription": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "shortDescTitle": "<p>Modular design. Optimal versatility.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
    "shortDescTop": "<p>Our Universal Trauma System is a comprehensive craniomaxillofacial plating system built from our experience with the Leibinger platform. The system includes a wide selection of high quality implants for bone fixation for craniomaxillofacial fractures, orthognathic and reconstructive surgery. Due to its modular concept, you can more easily achieve the balance between a comprehensive offering and a solution for specific indications. Module options include: 1.2 upperface, 1.7 midface, 2.0 mini plating, 2.0/2.3 mandible fracture, SMARTLock Hybrid MMF, MMF screws, skeletal anchorage, auxiliary screws, lag screws, bone grafting, screw removal and mesh.&nbsp;<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-76a17b8b97@example.invalid",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Sep 18 2017 13:38:10 GMT-0400",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/pageshortdescription",
    "textIsRich": [
      "true",
      "true",
      "true"
    ],
    "bulletList": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>You can customize modules based on your specific needs and preferences.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Color-coding of modules and instruments allows for easy identification.</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Graduated Stability Plates (GSP) offer the progressive level of fixation required as the advancement increases.</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "4": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>We offer malleable, low-profile plates in both the upperface and midface fixation modules that are an excellent micro-implant for the management of small bone fragments in non-load bearing regions of the skull.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "5": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>SMARTLoad screw delivery field in each module features recessed screw holes that may facilitate easy loading of the screw.</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "6": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Screw disc delivery system incorporates SMARTLoad screw delivery field for easy loading, color coding for easy identification and protects unexposed screws from spillage.</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "7": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Midface and mandible modules feature SMARTLock technology; a one step locking screw with a locking capability and up to 10˚ of angulation.</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      }
    }
  },
